# GameAction.changeZone runs ChangesZone for the move to the stack
# (GameAction.java:601-613): casting Geistflame for its flashback cost takes an
# instant card out of human's graveyard, so Murktide Regent's "Origin$
# Graveyard | Destination$ Any | ValidCard$ Instant.YouOwn" trigger puts a
# +1/+1 counter on it. The trigger goes on the stack above the spell.
startturn human
advance 3
tapformana human 2 R
tapformana human 3 R
tapformana human 4 R
tapformana human 5 R
queue paygeneric R
queue paygeneric R
queue paygeneric R
queue targets ai
castspell human 1
resolvestack
